          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>100</choice_text>
          <commentary>줄 한 가닥의 장력(100 N)이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>150</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>200</choice_text>
          <commentary>T = 100 N이므로 F = 2T = 200 N이 되어 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
